    65% 90%, 60% 85%, 55% 91%,
    50% 86%, 45% 89%, 40% 84%,
    35% 90%, 30% 86%, 25% 92%,
    20% 87%, 15% 90%, 10% 85%,
    5% 88%, 0% 85%
  );
}
```

#### Horizontal Scroll Section
